--- !u!114 &29381985
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 29381980}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6f3a8ebb15f0cb54884e8d834a38cc02, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  dialogue:
    name: Barry
    sentences:
    - Ewan, did'ja see my highscore at the arcade?!
    - I was playing Pac-Man for eight hours, and i got to level 256!
    - Did you know it's impossible to get past that? It's caused by a byte overflow-
    - Which forces the system to read the binary number from its memory, and-
    - (You stop listening.)
